{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "f3073ccf-7976-473b-b935-7702fa0c178c", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 0, "ts": "2026-07-30T17:50:31.531000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "uart1的时钟树定义与其他uart有所不同。你检查一下目前的初始化代码是否能兼容全部uart."}
