{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "f3073ccf-7976-473b-b935-7702fa0c178c", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 2, "ts": "2026-07-30T17:50:31.531000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_serial.c, /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk.c, /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk_fixed_factor.c, /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk_gate.c", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-1", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_serial.c", "/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk.c", "/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk_fixed_factor.c", "/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk_gate.c"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "f3073ccf-7976-473b-b935-7702fa0c178c", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-07-30T17:50:31.531000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "好，`clk_uart1_src_top` divider 有 `CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT`，可以传播到 mux。但问题是：**serial driver 拿到的是 `sclk_uart1`（fixed_factor），它没有 `CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT`，所以 `clk_set_rate` 不会传播到上游**。\n\n让我看看 divider 的 ops："}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "f3073ccf-7976-473b-b935-7702fa0c178c", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 4, "ts": "2026-07-30T17:52:07.583000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "给sclk_uart1加上CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT的flag是否更合理？"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "f3073ccf-7976-473b-b935-7702fa0c178c", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 5, "ts": "2026-07-30T17:51:46.568000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk_mux.c", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-0", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/drivers/clk/clk_mux.c"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "f3073ccf-7976-473b-b935-7702fa0c178c", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 6, "ts": "2026-07-30T17:52:07.583000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "修复完成。总结一下：\n\n## 分析\n\n**UART1 时钟树与其他 UART 的差异：**\n\n| | UART0, UART2~11 | UART1 |\n|---|---|---|\n| sclk 节点 | `sclk_uartN` (8-bit **divider**) | `sclk_uart1` (fixed_factor, pass-through) |\n| 本地分频器 | 有，直接在 `sclk_uartN` | 无，分频在上游 `clk_uart1_src_top_div` |\n| 时钟域 | CRU | PMU1CRU (Level 2) + CRU (Level 1) |\n\n**原问题**：`sclk_uart1` 注册时只有 `CLK_NAME_IS_STATIC`，缺少 `CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT`。当 serial driver 调用 `clk_set_rate(\"sclk_uart1\", baud*16)` 时，rate 无法传播到上游的 `clk_uart1_src_top_div` 分频器，导致 UART1 的 sclk 频率无法被正确配置。\n\n**修复**：给 `sclk_uart1` 的 `fixed_factor` 注册加上 `CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT`，使 rate 能沿链路传播：\n\n```\nclk_set_rate(\"sclk_uart1\", baud*16)\n  → sclk_uart1 (fixed_factor, CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT) ✅ 新增\n    → sclk_uart1_sel (mux, CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT)\n      → clk_uart1_src_top_en (gate) → clk_uart1_src_top (divider) ← 分频生效\n```"}
